{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Backstory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years ago, Soviet scientists discovered a unique resource - inexhaustible fuel. It could have been a powerful step toward the industrialization of the country, but instead became the crossing of a red line and the beginning of militarization. The war began.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras/cf1cd15956d964703c95ec9cb7030444.avif?t=1770599964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras_big/cf1cd15956d964703c95ec9cb7030444.avif?t=1770599964 width=1560 height=774 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deathmatch Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower - is a fast-paced competitive arcade shooter where players fight each other for the only path to salvation. Search for the key, kill opponents, and destroy the environment around you to carve the shortest path to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as one of eight residents. You all overslept the evacuation. The only way to survive is the last escape capsule.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras/9bcd63c75214bc9d534cd69e23785cac.avif?t=1770599964\" width=1560 height=814 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each hero, a different strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your hero. A quiet and elusive killer or a loud and powerful brute. Sneak and hide, or break through head-on to reach the coveted capsule.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras/c7cc1a46f6d180ccd4bb180b4ad3336c.avif?t=1770599964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural  Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room in the Tower is procedurally generated. Almost everything on the maps can be broken or destroyed. No two sessions will be the same.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras/2846d3a24d3578530a1bea1a329c8f74.avif?t=1770599964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rule-breaking artifacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use dozens of artifacts that change the rules of the world: distort perception, enhance the body, or bend the will of others.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global morality system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action you take shifts the balance of the world between trust and fear, subtly yet noticeably changing the experience for all participants of the bloody battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is made in the Soviet Punk style. It showcases a mix of late Soviet everyday life, forgotten heroes of the 90s, unseen technologies, and post-punk music that conveys the spirit of protest and the collapse of an era.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras/56009b4afe9105a8e7eb47f22e803f49.avif?t=1770599964\" width=1560 height=498 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3030200?t=1770599964","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/e8a2c38b5c77503c9293e89bf0f1293a2e36e0e2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770599964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/4bf79da1d20f1beeec2dee6e0049d7c0da84f10e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770599964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/4bf79da1d20f1beeec2dee6e0049d7c0da84f10e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770599964","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence, including shooting and melee combat with lethal outcomes. It features visual depictions of smoking and alcohol consumption."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Backstory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty years ago, Soviet scientists discovered a unique resource - inexhaustible fuel. It could have been a powerful step toward the industrialization of the country, but instead became the crossing of a red line and the beginning of militarization. The war began.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras/cf1cd15956d964703c95ec9cb7030444.avif?t=1770599964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras_big/cf1cd15956d964703c95ec9cb7030444.avif?t=1770599964 width=1560 height=774 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deathmatch Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower - is a fast-paced competitive arcade shooter where players fight each other for the only path to salvation. Search for the key, kill opponents, and destroy the environment around you to carve the shortest path to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as one of eight residents. You all overslept the evacuation. The only way to survive is the last escape capsule.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras/9bcd63c75214bc9d534cd69e23785cac.avif?t=1770599964\" width=1560 height=814 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each hero, a different strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your hero. A quiet and elusive killer or a loud and powerful brute. Sneak and hide, or break through head-on to reach the coveted capsule.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras/c7cc1a46f6d180ccd4bb180b4ad3336c.avif?t=1770599964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural  Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room in the Tower is procedurally generated. Almost everything on the maps can be broken or destroyed. No two sessions will be the same.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras/2846d3a24d3578530a1bea1a329c8f74.avif?t=1770599964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rule-breaking artifacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use dozens of artifacts that change the rules of the world: distort perception, enhance the body, or bend the will of others.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global morality system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action you take shifts the balance of the world between trust and fear, subtly yet noticeably changing the experience for all participants of the bloody battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is made in the Soviet Punk style. It showcases a mix of late Soviet everyday life, forgotten heroes of the 90s, unseen technologies, and post-punk music that conveys the spirit of protest and the collapse of an era.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030200/extras/56009b4afe9105a8e7eb47f22e803f49.avif?t=1770599964\" width=1560 height=498 /></span></p>","developers":["Dustpan Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea